  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pruned Crisis Mechanism SJR 2024-2026 in RD and Aleppo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is aiming to do the follow in WASH and EFSVL: * WASH: 1. Enhanced access to hygiene promotion/awareness raising activities 2. Enhanced access to sufficient and safe water for domestic use. 3. Enhanced access to to safe sewage and solid waste management systems. * EFSVL: 1. Rehabilitation and improvement of bakeries to provide increased food production in crisis -affected areas. 2. Provision of agricultural inputs/support. 3. Livelihoods support. * Protection: 1. community protection analysis. 2. provide logistical and material support to facilitate the implementation. 3. provide individual protection assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
